## 中文

本儲存庫的原始碼、文件與設計內容為著作權人所有。**公開於 GitHub
不代表授權任何人使用。**

未經著作權人事前書面同意，任何人不得重製、散布、公開傳輸、改作、
編輯、出租，或以本專案為基礎建立衍生著作，亦不得用於商業目的。

允許的行為僅限於：閱讀原始碼、為評估或學習目的在本機執行、
以及依 GitHub 服務條款所必然發生的重製（例如 fork 與 clone 的技術
行為本身）。

**第三方素材不在本聲明範圍內。** 本專案處理的題本、講義與詳解，
其著作權屬於原出版社或大學入學考試中心。本專案不散布任何此類內容，
`samples/` 目錄已排除於版本控制之外。使用本系統匯入受著作權保護的
教材時，使用者應自行確認其權利基礎。

本專案使用的開源相依套件各自適用其原本的授權條款，不受本聲明影響。

## English

The source code, documentation, and design contained in this repository
are the property of the copyright holder. **Public visibility on GitHub
does not grant any license to use them.**

No person may reproduce, distribute, publicly transmit, adapt, edit,
rent, or create derivative works based on this project, nor use it for
commercial purposes, without the prior written consent of the copyright
holder.

Permitted uses are limited to: reading the source, running it locally
for evaluation or study, and the reproduction inherent in GitHub's own
terms of service (i.e. the technical act of forking or cloning).

**Third-party material is outside the scope of this notice.** The
worksheets, handouts, and explanatory content this system processes
remain the copyright of their original publishers or of Taiwan's College
Entrance Examination Center. This project distributes none of it; the
`samples/` directory is excluded from version control. Users importing
copyrighted teaching material are responsible for establishing their own
rights basis.

Open-source dependencies remain under their own respective licenses and
are unaffected by this notice.

